\b\cf0\ulc0\insrsid11893064  }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid11893064 When do organizational people indulged themselves in organizational politics? Discuss any five factors in detail.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\cf0\ulc0\insrsid11893064 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf0\ulc0\insrsid7820760 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf2\ulc0\insrsid7820760\charrsid7820760 Answer: }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf2\ulc0\insrsid7820760 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf2\ulc0\insrsid7820760\charrsid7820760 
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\wrapdefault\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid7820760 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\insrsid7820760\charrsid7820760 
Organizational politics are actions that allow people in organizations to attain goals without goi
ng through ceremonial channels. Whether political activities help or hurt the organization depends on whether the person's goals are steady with the organization's goals. In the impartial model of organizations, people are assumed to manage sensibly, base
d on clear information and well-defined goals.
\par 
\par There are few factors that result in political activities in an organization  and are explained as under.
\par 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f1\cf2\ulc1\insrsid7820760\charrsid7820760 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 1.\tab}}\pard \ltrpar\ql \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar
\jclisttab\tx720\wrapdefault\faauto\ls2\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid7820760 {\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f1\cf2\insrsid7820760\charrsid7820760 Changes in Leadership}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\insrsid7820760\charrsid7820760 
 which changes conventional associations and processes can create an opportunity for increased political behavior.
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\wrapdefault\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid7820760 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\insrsid7820760\charrsid7820760 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f1\cf2\ulc1\insrsid7820760\charrsid7820760 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 2.\tab}}\pard \ltrpar\ql \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar
\jclisttab\tx720\wrapdefault\faauto\ls2\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid7820760 {\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f1\cf2\insrsid7820760\charrsid7820760 Changes in Coordination and integration}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af1 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f1\cf2\insrsid7820760\charrsid7820760  of organizational activities used to achieve common goals can also lead to an increase in political behavior.
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\wrapdefault\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid7820760 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\insrsid7820760\charrsid7820760 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f1\cf2\ulc1\insrsid7820760\charrsid7820760 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 3.\tab}}\pard \ltrpar\ql \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar
\jclisttab\tx720\wrapdefault\faauto\ls2\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid7820760 {\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f1\cf2\insrsid7820760\charrsid7820760 Changes in any of the five contextual forces, i.e. }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af1 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f1\cf2\insrsid7820760\charrsid7820760 environment, technology, strategy, culture, and structure, can generate uncertainty over resource allocation, leading to an increase in political behavior. 
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\wrapdefault\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid7820760 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\insrsid7820760\charrsid7820760 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f1\cf2\ulc1\insrsid7820760\charrsid7820760 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 4.\tab}}\pard \ltrpar\ql \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar
\jclisttab\tx720\wrapdefault\faauto\ls2\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid7820760 {\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f1\cf2\insrsid7820760\charrsid7820760 Blame & Integration.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\insrsid7820760\charrsid7820760  Blamin
g and attacking others to deflect attention from one's mistakes and using ingratiating behavior to gain favor are unethical and negative types of political actions.
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\wrapdefault\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid7820760 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\insrsid7820760\charrsid7820760 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f1\cf2\ulc1\insrsid7820760\charrsid7820760 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 5.\tab}}\pard \ltrpar\ql \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar
\jclisttab\tx720\wrapdefault\faauto\ls2\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid7820760 {\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f1\cf2\insrsid7820760\charrsid7820760 Building Relationship}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\insrsid7820760\charrsid7820760 
. People develop relationships through coalitions, grouping, netwo
rks, and accommodating managerial linkages. Coalitions are relationships formed over specific issues. Alliances are general agreements of support among different individuals and groups; and networks are broad, loose support systems. Relationship building 
can either help or harm the organization.
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\wrapdefault\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf0\ulc0\insrsid7820760 
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\wrapdefault\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf0\ulc0\insrsid11893064     }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid11893064 
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\wrapdefault\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\cf0\ulc0\insrsid11893064 Question No: 54    ( Marks: 10 ) 
\par }\pard \ltrpar\qj \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\wrapdefault\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\cf0\ulc0\insrsid5460395 {\pict{\*\picprop\shplid1078{\sp{\sn shapeType}{\sv 75}}{\sp{\sn fFlipH}{\sv 0}}
{\sp{\sn fFlipV}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn fLine}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn fLayoutInCell}{\sv 1}}{\sp{\sn fLayoutInCell}{\sv 1}}}\picscalex100\picscaley100\piccropl0\piccropr0\piccropt0\piccropb0
