\b\cf0\ulc0\insrsid11893064  }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid11893064 In order to get advantage of each method, will it be a sensible decision to simultaneously}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid11893064  }{
\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid11893064 apply all the four methods of job evaluation?}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf0\ulc0\insrsid11893064 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf0\ulc0\insrsid11679424 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid11679424\charrsid11679424 Answer: 
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li540\ri566\nowidctlpar\wrapdefault\faauto\rin566\lin540\itap0\pararsid11679424 {\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f1\cf2\insrsid11679424\charrsid11679424 Four methods of Job evaluation
\par 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f1\cf2\ulc1\insrsid11679424\charrsid11679424 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 1.\tab}}\pard \ltrpar\ql \fi-360\li1260\ri566\widctlpar
\jclisttab\tx1260\wrapdefault\faauto\ls3\rin566\lin1260\itap0\pararsid11679424 {\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f1\cf2\insrsid11679424\charrsid11679424 Ranking Method: }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\insrsid11679424\charrsid11679424 
Raters examine the description of each job being evaluated and assemble the jobs according to their value to the corporation. This technique requires a team characteristically composed of both management and employee delegate to arrange job in a simple ra
nk order from uppermost to lowest. The most noticeable restraint to the ranking method is its utter lack of ability to be managed when there are a large number of jobs.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f1\cf2\insrsid11679424\charrsid11679424 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f1\cf2\ulc1\insrsid11679424\charrsid11679424 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 2.\tab}Classification Method: }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\insrsid11679424\charrsid11679424 
A job evaluation method by which a number of classes or ratings are defined to explain a group of jobs is known as categorization method. The classifications are created by identifying some common denominator skills, knowledge, }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af1 
\ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\insrsid14507131\charrsid11679424 and responsibilities}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\insrsid11679424\charrsid11679424  with the desired goal being the criterion of a number of distinctive classes or grades of jobs.}{\rtlch\fcs1 
\ab\af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f1\cf2\insrsid11679424\charrsid11679424 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f1\cf2\ulc1\insrsid11679424\charrsid11679424 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 3.\tab}Factor Comparison Method }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\insrsid11679424\charrsid11679424 
Raters need not keep the entire job in mind as they evaluate instead, they make decisions on separate phases, or issues, of the job. A basic fundamental hypothesis is that there are five universal job 
factors:  (1) Mental Requirements (2) Skills (3) Physical Requirements (4) Responsibilities 5) Working Conditions. 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f1\cf2\ulc1\insrsid11679424\charrsid11679424 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 4.\tab}}{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f1\cf2\insrsid11679424\charrsid11679424 Point Method: }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af1 
\ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf2\insrsid11679424\charrsid11679424 Raters assign numerical values to specific job components, and the sum of these values provides a quantitative appraisal of a job\rquote 
s relative significance. The point method requires selection of job factors according to the nature of the specific group of jobs being evaluated. After determining the group of jobs to be studied, analysts conduct job analysis and write job descrip
tions. Next, the analysts select and define the factors to be used in measuring job value and which become the standards used for the evaluation of jobs. Education, experience, job knowledge, mental effort, physical effort, responsibility, and working con
ditions are examples of factors typically used.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f1\cf2\insrsid11679424\charrsid11679424 
\par }\pard \ltrpar\qj \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\wrapdefault\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf0\ulc0\insrsid11679424 
\par }{\*\themedata 504b030414000600080000002100828abc13fa0000001c020000130000005b436f6e74656e745f54797065735d2e786d6cac91cb6ac3301045f785fe83d0b6d8
